[2026-04-14T07:54:52.120Z] [INFO]         "content": "1\t---\n2\tbump: minor\n3\t---\n4\t\n5\t### Added\n6\t- Configured `rust-toolchain.toml` with nightly-2022-08-22 for reproducible builds\n7\t- Added comprehensive CONTRIBUTING.md with development guidelines\n8\t- Added changelog fragment system with `changelog.d/` directory for conflict-free versioning\n9\t- Added utility scripts for version management and release automation\n10\t- Added `.pre-commit-config.yaml` for code quality hooks\n11\t- Added code coverage reporting with cargo-llvm-cov and Codecov integration\n12\t- Added extensive test coverage for data module (Link, Doublet, Error, Handler/Fuse)\n13\t- Added comprehensive tests for traits module (Doublets, DoubletsExt, Links)\n14\t- Added tests for memory module components (LinksHeader, stores)\n15\t\n16\t### Changed\n17\t- Improved CI/CD workflow with template best practices\n18\t- Added concurrency control to prevent duplicate CI runs\n19\t- Added automatic release workflow based on changelog fragments\n20\t- Added manual release dispatch option for maintainers\n21\t"
