ursion_less_base.rs\n            ├── internal_sources_linked_list.rs\n            ├── internal_sources_recursion_less_tree.rs\n            ├── internal_targets_recursion_less_tree.rs\n            ├── external_sources_recursion_less_tree.rs\n            ├── external_targets_recursion_less_tree.rs\n            └── unused_links.rs\n```\n\n**FFI Bindings** (`/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776153218771/doublets-ffi/src/`):\n- Single `lib.rs` file (12,279 lines) - C-compatible FFI interface\n\n**Proc Macros**:\n- `doublets-ffi/ffi-attributes/src/lib.rs` (5,739 lines) - FFI attribute macro\n- `doublets-ffi/env-decorators/src/lib.rs` (2,083 lines) - Environment decorator macro\n\n**Decorators** (excluded from build):\n- `doublets-decorators/src/` - Decorator pattern implementations (under rework)\n\n**Integration Tests**:\n- `integration/src/lib.rs`\n- `integration/src/bins/test-mem.rs` - Memory test binary\n\n---\n\n### 7. CI SCRIPTS & UTILITIES\n\n**`/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776153218771/ci/miri.sh`**:\n- Installs latest Miri nightly toolchain\n- Runs Miri memory safety checks with `-Zmiri-disable-stacked-borrows`\n\n**`/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776153218771/scripts/`** (Node.js/JavaScript utilities):\n- `check-file-size.mjs` - Enforces 1000 line limit per Rust file\n- `get-bump-type.mjs` - Parses changelog fragments and determines semantic version bump\n- `collect-changelog.mjs` - Collects fragment files into CHANGELOG.md\n- `version-and-commit.mjs` - Updates version in Cargo.toml and creates commit\n- `create-github-release.mjs` - Creates GitHub release\n- `bump-version.mjs` - Semantic version bumping logic\n\n---\n\n### 8. DOCUMENTATION & CONFIGURATION\n\n**Documentation Files**:\n- `/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776153218771/README.md` - Main project README (263 lines)\n  - Covers: overview, key features, installation, examples, API overview, architecture, features, performance, dependencies\n- `/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776153218771/CONTRIBUTING.md` - Contributing guidelines (311 lines)\n  - Development setup, workflow, code style, testing guidelines, PR process, changelog management, release process\n- `/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776153218771/CHANGELOG.md` - Release changelog (18 lines)\n  - Header format, initial release entry, changelog insert point\n\n**Changelog System**:\n- `/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776153218771/changelog.d/README.md` - Fragment documentation\n- `/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776153218771/changelog.d/20251228_030839_ai_driven_pipeline.md` - Example fragment with minor bump, added features\n\n**Code Quality Configuration**:\n- `/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776153218771/rustfmt.toml`:\n  - `error_on_line_overflow = true`\n  - `error_on_unformatted = true`\n  - `version = \"Two\"`\n  - `imports_granularity = \"Crate\"`\n\n- `/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776153218771/.pre-commit-config.yaml`:\n  - Standard pre-commit hooks (trailing whitespace, end-of-file, YAML, large files, merge conflicts, TOML)\n  - Local hooks for `cargo fmt`, `cargo clippy`, `cargo test`\n\n- `/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776153218771/.travis.yml` - Legacy Travis CI config (minimal)\n\n**License**:\n- Unlicense (public domain)\n\n---\n\n### 9. KEY INSIGHTS\n\n1. **Monolithic FFI**: The FFI bindings are in a single 12,279-line file, which exceeds the 1,000-line guideline enforced by `check-file-size.mjs`\n2. **Pinned Old Nightly**: Uses nightly-2022-08-22 (from August 2022), which is ~3+ years old\n3. **Uninitialized Submodules**: Git submodules for platform dependencies are not checked out (marked with `-` in git submodule status)\n4. **Excluded Decorators**: `doublets-decorators` crate is explicitly excluded from the workspace, indicating it's under rework\n5. **Automated Release Pipeline**: Sophisticated changelog fragment system with automatic semantic versioning and GitHub release creation\n6. **Cross-Platform Testing**: Tests run on Linux, macOS, and Windows with different CPU feature sets\n7. **Miri Disabled**: Memory safety checking with Miri is disabled due to nightly compatibility issues\n8.