[2026-04-14T08:07:47.504Z] [INFO]         "text": "Now the big problem: `RawMem` API change. The old `mem::RawMem<T>` trait has:\n- `alloc(capacity) -> Result<&mut [T]>` \n- `allocated() -> usize`\n- `grow(capacity) -> Result<&mut [T]>`\n- `shrink(capacity) -> Result<&mut [T]>`\n\nThe new `mem::RawMem` trait has:\n- `type Item`\n- `allocated() -> &[Self::Item]`\n- `allocated_mut() -> &mut [Self::Item]`\n- `unsafe grow(cap, fill) -> Result<&mut [Self::Item]>`\n- `shrink(cap) -> Result<()>`\n\nThe doublets `Store` uses `RawMem<LinkPart<T>>` with `self.mem.alloc(n)`, `self.mem.allocated()`, and `self.mem.grow(n)`. I need to adapt this. Let me also check if `DEFAULT_PAGE_SIZE` is still exported:"
[2026-04-14T08:07:47.504Z] [INFO]       }
