[2026-04-14T08:22:10.834Z] [INFO]             "text": "Perfect! I have the CI workflow. Let me provide you with a comprehensive analysis:\n\n## CI/CD Pipeline Structure for mem-rs\n\n**Workflow File:** `.github/workflows/release.yml`\n\n### Toolchain Version\n- **Rust Toolchain:** Stable (via `dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable`)\n- **Build Environment Variable:** `RUSTFLAGS: -Dwarnings` (treats warnings as errors)\n- **Color Support:** `CARGO_TERM_COLOR: always`\n\n### Jobs and Their Dependencies\n\n1. **detect-changes** (trigger: push/PR)\n   - Determines which jobs should run based on file changes\n   - Outputs: rs-changed, toml-changed, docs-changed, workflow-changed, any-code-changed\n   - Skipped on workflow_dispatch\n\n2. **changelog** (trigger: PR with code changes)\n   - Requires changelog fragments for code changes\n   - Skips docs-only PRs\n   - Uses rust-script for validation\n\n3. **version-check** (trigger: PR only)\n   - Prevents manual version modification in PRs\n   - Ensures versions only change via automated release pipeline\n\n4. **lint** (runs on push, workflow_dispatch, or code/docs changes)\n   - Components: rustfmt, clippy\n   - Checks: formatting, clippy lints, file size limits\n   - Uses caching for cargo registry\n\n5. **test** (matrix: ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest)\n   - Runs unit tests and doc tests\n   - Requires changelog to pass or be skipped\n   - Cross-platform testing\n\n6. **build**\n   - Runs release build after lint/test pass\n   - Verifies package creation\n\n7. **auto-release** (trigger: push to main, after successful build)\n   - Automatic semantic versioning based on changelog fragments\n   - Publishes to crates.io\n   - Creates GitHub release\n   - Uses rust-script for version management\n\n8. **manual-release** (trigger: workflow_dispatch with release_mode='instant')\n   - Manual release option with bump type selection (patch/minor/major)\n   - Supports optional description\n   - Publishes to crates.io and creates GitHub release\n\n9. **deploy-docs** (trigger: after auto-release or manual-release success)\n   - Builds Rust documentation with `cargo doc --no-deps`\n   - Deploys to GitHub Pages under `/rust` destination directory\n   - Uses peaceiris/actions-gh-pages@v4\n\n10. **changelog-pr** (trigger: workflow_dispatch with release_mode='changelog-pr')\n    - Creates a PR with changelog fragment for manual releases\n    - Allows review before automatic merge and release\n\n### Key Checks and Automation\n- **Changelog Management:** Fragments-based versioning with changelog aggregation\n- **Release Modes:** Instant release, changelog PR workflow, or automatic on main\n- **Secrets Used:** CARGO_REGISTRY_TOKEN (or CARGO_TOKEN), GITHUB_TOKEN\n- **Concurrency:** Cancels in-progress runs for same workflow+ref\n- **File Size Limits:** Checked via custom rust-script\n- **Version Control:** Automated bump detection prevents manual version changes in PRs\n\nThe workflow is production-ready with comprehensive checks, multi-platform testing, automated versioning, and built-in documentation deployment to GitHub Pages."
